WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.025
Four ropes hold the sack, but every pulley wheel rubs a little.

2
00:00:04.651 --> 00:00:07.501
Each wheel passes on only ninety percent.

3
00:00:08.304 --> 00:00:11.179
Four wheels multiply to about two thirds.

4
00:00:15.433 --> 00:00:18.058
The missing work becomes heat and sound.
